Wingman Jr. N017 — model weights
================================

The `group1-shard*of10.bin` files in this directory are the TensorFlow.js
weight shards of the N017 image-safety model from the Wingman Jr. project:

    https://github.com/wingman-jr-addon/model/tree/master/N017

N017 is a MobileNetV4 Hybrid-Medium model fine-tuned from timm's
`mobilenetv4_hybrid_medium.e500_r224_in1k` checkpoint. Its serialized weights
and graph representations are published under the
**Apache License, Version 2.0**:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
    (upstream notice: N017/N017_WEIGHTS_LICENSE.md)

IMPORTANT: these files are NOT covered by `data/LICENSE` (MIT), which applies
to the blocklist and whitelist data in this repository. They remain under
Apache-2.0, and that license travels with them.

They are upstream's files, byte-for-byte unmodified
(`N017/tfjs/n017_graph_model/group1-shard*of10.bin`). The matching graph
topology, also unmodified, ships inside the extension package as
`models/n017/model.json`.

Why they live here rather than in the extension package: the BlockNSFW
extension fetches them on first use and caches them locally. The ~39 MB is paid
only by users who choose the Wingman N017 classifier, not by everyone who
installs the extension. They are served from this directory via
`N017_WEIGHTS_BASE_URL` in `shared/ai-image-models.js`. If these files are ever
re-published, bump `N017_WEIGHTS_VERSION` in that same file. It is part of the
client-side cache key, and without a bump clients keep serving the old weights
from cache indefinitely.

See also THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the repository root.
